>> Combination := Mndandanda chatsopano.

Combination chikafika: ['onjeza-kumapeto:'] chitani: { :el
	wekha 
	pezani: el, Palibe? zoona: { wekha onjeza-kumapeto: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination chatsopano.
colours
	onjeza-kumapeto: ['red'],
	onjeza-kumapeto: ['green'],
	onjeza-kumapeto: ['blue'],
	onjeza-kumapeto: ['red'].

Zotuluka lembani: colours, mzere-watsopano.
